Selection tool complete (2026-06-20).

Delivered the assigned milestone — marquee selection with move / scale / delete —
plus duplicate (Ctrl+J) and arrow-key nudge. AutoCAD-style directional marquee
(left→right = window/contain, right→left = crossing). All transforms are single
undoable commits. 22 new tests in test/selection.test.cjs; full suite 100/100 green.
See NOTES.md "Selection tool" (Architecture) for the design and the documented
watch-outs. Suggested next: selection-aware copy/paste, a rotate handle, or layers.
